OL,3,AInterest rates held but Bank signals
OL,4,Arise if energy prices stay high
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bank now forecasts that inflation
OL,7,Fwill rise more than it previously
OL,8,Fthought and warned that the price cap
OL,9,Fon household gas and electricity bills
OL,10,Ffor January is "now expected to rise
OL,11,Fsubstantially further".
